 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "center",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# New'O'Nautics\n## Mod Map\n\n**Green arrow** = similar AND mergeable (we could share their recipes or data).\n\n**Red arrow** = a new connection we could build.\n\nOther versions: `Mod Map.canvas` (both), `Mod Map - Similar.canvas` (green only), `Mod Map - Connect.canvas` (red only).\n\nOnly connections we can implement are shown (the rest were removed 2026-10-08).\n\nColoured branches = category -> mod.\n\nBuilt 2026-10-07 from the 228 jars in `mods/`. Edges are suggestions; edit freely.\n\nSee [[Pack Scan - Compat Features]], [[Electricity Audit]].",
   "x": -310,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 509
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_food",
   "type": "text",
